    <description>This recruiting agent helps candidates apply for jobs by searching for open roles based on their preferences. If a match is found, it asks for basic details like name, email, and phone to create a candidate record. Then, it provides a link for the candidate to upload their resume. Once the resume is uploaded, the agent thanks them for applying!</description>
